*** Analyse Demographics 
*Created a new column called Demographics. This used an IF statement to translate the age groups into lables Senior, Under 30 and Other.
Demographics = 
IF(
'Databel - Data'[Age] >= 30,
"Senior",
IF(
'Databel - Data'[Age] < 30,
"Under 30",
"Other"
)
)
This measure didn't work but after inspecting the data closer, I realised that there were two Boolean columns labeled "Senior" and "Under 30" with values yes or no.
After realising this, I made the following changes to the demographic measure:
Demographics = IF('Databel - Data'[Senior]="Yes","Senior",If('Databel - Data'[Under 30]="Yes","Under 30","Other"))
This change then provided me with a usable result.
